### 회원 전체 조회 → 200
GET http://localhost:8080/practice/swagger/members

### 회원 상세 조회 → 200
GET http://localhost:8080/practice/swagger/members/1

### [문제 4-1] 없는 회원 조회 → 404
GET http://localhost:8080/practice/swagger/members/99

### [문제 5] 회원 등록 → 201 + Location 헤더 확인
POST http://localhost:8080/practice/swagger/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "member04",
  "name": "강감찬",
  "email": "kang@test.com"
}

### [문제 5] Location 헤더 주소로 조회 → 방금 등록한 회원
GET http://localhost:8080/practice/swagger/members/4

### 회원 정보 수정 → 200
PUT http://localhost:8080/practice/swagger/members/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "홍길순",
  "email": "hong2@test.com"
}

### [문제 4-2] 없는 회원 수정 → 404
PUT http://localhost:8080/practice/swagger/members/99
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "아무개",
  "email": "nobody@test.com"
}

### 회원 삭제 → 204
DELETE http://localhost:8080/practice/swagger/members/2

### [문제 4-3] 없는 회원 삭제 → 404
DELETE http://localhost:8080/practice/swagger/members/99
